WEBVTT

00:19:07.163 --> 00:19:09.621
Susan Davids talk is so comforting.

00:19:09.996 --> 00:19:12.288
I feel I can breathe again
after listening to it.

00:19:12.829 --> 00:19:18.121
It helps validate the fact that we all
hold in so much we brewed bottle up

00:19:18.121 --> 00:19:21.871
and carry around the heavy weight that
comes with needing to be positive,

00:19:22.454 --> 00:19:26.538
even though there's so many situations
around us that are sometimes sad

00:19:26.538 --> 00:19:28.621
or difficult, dire or even tragic.

00:19:29.371 --> 00:19:31.454
Many of Susan's examples focused